    old "But whatever eagerness his body revealed, he did not rush her."
    new "Aber egal, wie sehr sein Körper sich danach sehnte, er eilte ihr nicht nach."

    old "Before long, Sarah felt a frenzy overtake her."
    new "Bald überkam Sarah eine Raserei."

    old "Begging seemed to help as Jaeid entered her deeper."
